WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:05,260
Story on the farm.

2
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:16,860
Hi kids, welcome to my farm. How are you?

3
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:20,390
I'm hungry.

4
00:00:20,390 --> 00:00:27,850
An apple for you, Julie.

5
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:31,060
I'm thirsty.

6
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:36,380
Some orange juice for you, Anne.

7
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,380
I'm hot.

8
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:41,690
A fan for you, John.

9
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:44,780
Ruff, ruff.

10
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:48,950
My trousers.

11
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:56,100
Oh no! Look out, robot.

12
00:00:56,100 --> 00:01:01,500
Thank you, Mark.

13
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:05,580
You're welcome.

14
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:09,580
How are the children on the farm?
